sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Pinner as CertificatePinner
    participant Srv as Server / MITM

    App->>Srv: TLS ClientHello
    Srv-->>App: certificate chain
    App->>Pinner: compute SPKI hash of chain keys
    alt matches a pin (real server)
        Pinner-->>App: OK -> proceed over TLS
    else MITM cert (valid CA, wrong key)
        Pinner-->>App: no pin match -> SSLPeerUnverifiedException
        App->>App: fail closed + report
    end
